Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||04-27-2001||03:52 AM||||the lights do pop up.. when they're down, the round lights are half hidden.<P>there's an asuna sunfire and an isuzu impulse at my school, and they're virtually identical.. only minor cosmetic differences. very nice dash inside, would look good in a fiero..<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
