Z||000005||p4n1c||04-27-2001||11:50 AM||||Actually I think GM bought Asuna and moved the vehicles to different companies(like Pontiac and Geo).  There is the Asuna SunRunner(which later became the Pontiac Sunrunner which was then later the Geo Tracker), The Asuna SunFire(which I think later became the Geo Storm and Isuzu Impulse).<P>I'm not sure if they were parallel models or all the other companies cars branched from the Asuna line.  I am pretty sure though that the Pontiac Sunrunner came after the Asuna Sunrunner. And the Pontiac Sunfire(even though it looks totally different).<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>"Each passing day, every passing face seems like such a blur" <BR>- The Offspring(Million Miles Away)<p>[This message has been edited by p4n1c (edited 04-27-2001).]||||reg||1
