Z||000008||Spektyr||04-30-2001||05:21 AM||||I knew that the 88's had better handling, I didn't know it was done by Lotus.<P>What exactly does that mean?  One of my roommates has always wanted a Lotus, and even daydreamed about building a Lotus/Fiero kit car.  I'd bet that if I could convince him that an 88 Fiero handled like a Lotus it wouldn't be hard to convert him into another Fiero-junkie.<P>Then his God-like web-design and web-admin skills could be put to use designing the Ultimate Fiero Club site!  (um... time for the pink pill I think)<P>Anyway, it'd just be nice to have someone around the house that didn't glare at me when I mentioned my car.  So how close exactly is the 88 handling to the Lotus?<P>------------------<BR>85 GT (to be modified...)<BR>--Um, no the paint isn't oxidized, that's the ultra-rare Whirlpool White textured finish... yeah.<BR>89 Lincoln Town Car (has Fiero Envy)<BR>--Hey!  Can I have an anti-sway bar too?||||reg||1
